                <div class="rendering rendering_researchoutput  rendering_researchoutput_vancouver rendering_contributiontojournal rendering_vancouver rendering_contributiontojournal_vancouver"><a rel="Person" href="https://researchprofiles.ku.dk/da/persons/jakob-johan-demant/" class="link"><span>Demant JJ</span></a>, Munksgaard R, Houborg E. <span class="title"><a rel="ContributionToJournal" href="https://researchprofiles.ku.dk/da/publications/personal-use-social-supply-or-redistribution-cryptomarket-demand-/" class="link"><span>Personal use, social supply or redistribution? <span class="subtitle">cryptomarket demand on Silk Road 2 and Agora</span></span></a></span>. <a rel="Journal" href="#" class="link"><span>Trends in Organized Crime</span></a>. 2018;21(1):42-61. doi: 10.1007/s12117-016-9281-4</div>
